              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">A quality coating carries a 10-year warranty; crack injection is effectively permanent; interior drains and exterior membranes last the life of the home. Sump pumps need replacing every 7–10 years and backup batteries every 3–5 years.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
